WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:14,050
I think there's a value in going to a practitioner who looks at your live blood.

00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:16,790
I think it may be called microscopy.

00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:25,290
It's called dark field microscopy or live cell microscopy.

00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:27,890
There is pros and cons to it.

00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:33,530
So first of all, it's highly illegal in many states.

00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:53,530
The reason is not always wrong because a lot of dark field microscopy practitioners, it's something you have to be fairly skilled at in order to really get a good reading.

00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:56,530
I think there's a lot of value in it.

00:00:56,530 --> 00:01:03,530
I think there's benefit to it, but it's not going to...

00:01:03,530 --> 00:01:06,530
I don't know how much information you're going to get off it at this time.

00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:09,530
You certainly can go and get tested. It's not very expensive.

00:01:09,530 --> 00:01:12,530
And you could get a look at it.

00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:17,530
Like a bit of soda, you can't do that under even as lay person.

00:01:17,530 --> 00:01:20,530
You could get people that throw it in jail.

